WEBVTT

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.040
I brought you some coffee.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.330
For all your hard work.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.160
Yeah, thanks.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:29.920
Hey...

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:30.920
Yes?

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.670
Well, how should I put this?

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.770
Has something good happened recently?

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:38.930
Yes! After all...

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:43.420
I now know that you love me, Onii-chan.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.280
Huh?

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.380
Huh?

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.440
Oh, I mean...

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.700
You proclaimed your love
 for me, loud and clear.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.070
N-Not that it made me happy or anything...

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.690
<i>I can say it to you now.</i>

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:02.150
<i>I love you more than anything in the world.</i>

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:07.500
Oh? Oh! You mean, when I was Towano Chikai?

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.070
Yes, that's right.

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:11.260
Your heartfelt confession was—

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:13.370
I completely inhabited his character.

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.510
Huh? It was an act?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.360
You didn't realize?

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:22.540
Those words were Towano Chikai's.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:25.890
I mean, I don't love you in that way, you know?

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:31.800
But at least I'm finally able to act
 like the characters as your stand-in.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:38.370
U-Uh, Suzuka-san?

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:44.590
Onii-chan, you still haven't 
fully become Towano Chikai!

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.710
Huh?! Why do you say that?!

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:47.960
It was good enough for you to—

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.400
It's nowhere near good enough!

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.610
You have to be Towano Chikai, day and night!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:54.440
If you keep slacking off like this,

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:56.170
people will start doubting you again!

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:01.300
Why can't you understand that 
you <i>must </i>love little sisters 24/7?!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.610
That makes no sense!

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.010
Take a chill pill!

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.170
So, with that said, Onii-chan...

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.980
We're going on a date right now! As training!

00:02:09.440 --> 00:02:11.740
Why is this happening to me?!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:50.620
Episode 6: Our Hakuou Girl's School Culture Festival

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.420
<i>Please don't run. It's dangerous.</i>

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:05.300
<i>Anyone wanting to enter the 
west hall, please line up over here.</i>

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.430
<i>Yes, please form an orderly line!</i>

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.310
<i>Don't stand to the side and try to cut in!</i>

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:13.340
<i>The Comic Stage is now open.</i>

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:18.820
<b>End of Line</b>

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:17.550
Excuse us! Line coming through!

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.820
Line coming through!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.600
Pardon us! Please let us through!

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.320
Pardon us! Coming through!

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.540
Thank you very much.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.070
One copy of your new book, please!

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:30.490
Pardon me, coming through!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.250
Good. Onto the next one.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.780
This one, please.

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.200
The new book, right?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.340
That'll be 1,000 yen.

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.190
Thank you very much.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.490
Your old book, please.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:46.790
Th-That'll be 500 yen.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.850
Th-Thank you very much!

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.160
We're finally over the initial rush.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:58.130
Yeah.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:01.200
I know we came here as a 
research-gathering exercise,

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:05.280
but I didn't realize doujinshi 
conventions were such a free-for-all.

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:08.870
This con is the biggest of its kind.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.300
As a light novel author,

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:12.030
you need to know about otaku culture, too.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.930
So experiencing it for 
yourself is the best way.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:17.040
That might be true, but...

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.980
Did I really need to cosplay?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:21.380
<b>The end of the
 line is here!</b>

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.010
What are you saying?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:21.500
<b>The end of the
 line is here!</b>

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.010
<b>The end of the 
line is here!!</b>

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:27.010
This is a convention, so if you're 
not enjoying it, you're missing out!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.820
That was an ordeal.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.700
Oh, sorry for keeping you guys waiting.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.870
Oh, Minazuki-san. Are you 
done making your rounds?

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.520
Yes, I managed to buy all the books I wanted.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.020
Oh, I'll take over the stall for you.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.490
Oh, thanks.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.400
You guys...

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.660
Up your customer service game.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.870
There are still people buying
 these porn rags, you know.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:57.370
Hey, it's seriously rude to call 
Double Peace-sensei's work "porn rags."

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.360
Y-You know <i>exactly</i> what's in these things.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.130
I'm just telling it like it is.

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:03.610
<i>Obscene!</i>

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.600
Thank you very much!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.260
Her artwork's good, so she'd probably 
sell better if she was more family-friendly.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.920
That'll never happen!

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:15.020
I love degrading rape porn too much!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.150
Also, Sensei...

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:19.360
You need to remember to say 
the "Ahegao" part of my name.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:20.270
Hey.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.950
You got anything left to sell?

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:24.680
Runa-chan?!

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:26.240
And Kino-chan's here, too?

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.970
Acquaintances of yours?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.680
Less acquaintances, more <i>rivals</i>.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.820
Right, Ah-he?

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:37.270
I wish you'd call me Ahegao 
Double Peace, instead of Ah-he.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.710
There's no way that phrase is passing my lips!

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:41.130
Good grief...

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.460
I don't think I've met you guys before.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:50.050
I'm Kanzaka Haruna, illustrator 
for our circle, Ambivalence.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:50.970
Nice to meet you.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:55.070
This is my older sister, and our writer...

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:56.970
Kanzaka Akino.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.690
"Ambivalence"? You mean, 
the major doujinshi circle?!

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.370
The Ambivalence whose 
books get pride of place,

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.440
and are always sat at the top of the 
rankings when it comes to bookstore sales?

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.630
We're already sold out for the day,

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.950
and as we had nothing else 
to do, we came to see you.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.450
Obscene!

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:17.180
You haven't changed one bit.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.450
Are you an idiot?!

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:21.210
You're never gonna sell 
all of these monstrosities!

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.670
Th-Those have been put aside 
for people who are turning up later.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:30.420
Why don't you stop drawing this junk and 
get your books in photo ops like ours?

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:34.640
Even if I wanted to, that's 
not something I could manage.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.430
Is that so?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:40.520
Guess it would be impossible for 
someone with so little ambition.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.480
Sorry for asking too much of you.

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:44.760
<i>What?</i>

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:47.480
<i>What </i>is<i> their relationship 
with Double Peace-sensei?</i>

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:52.780
Oh, that reminds me. I hear you started 
illustrating a light novel recently.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.110
A creepy one about a little sister.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.850
To tell you the truth, we're 
making our light novel debut, too.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:02.460
I'm illustrating, and my sister's writing it.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:03.990
Runa-chan.

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:05.840
I don't care what you say about me,

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:09.210
but could you leave off
 Towano Chikai-sensei?

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:10.560
"Towano"?

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:14.060
Oh, the author of that crappy 
little sister light novel?

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.280
That yawnfest has zero story and just
 goes in for pure little sister moe,

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.380
so we'll surpass it in no time.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.470
Huh?

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.520
Hey!

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:24.960
I'll never forgive you!

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.730
What's <i>your</i> problem?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.940
I'm Towano Chikai...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.750
...'s little sister!

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:39.580
"Little sister"? Which means...

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:42.160
So you're Towano Chikai, huh?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:45.500
Yes. You were very rude about me just now.

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:48.390
Well, what I said is true, isn't it?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:53.520
Is your own work good enough for you 
to go around criticizing others?

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.790
Just listen to this guy.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.780
Okay, let's have a competition.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.430
Huh? How did you jump to that?

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:04.720
We'll both create doujinshi 
based on your light novel.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:08.750
Then, we'll sell them at the next ComiSta 
and we'll find out who's better.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:10.660
Now, just hold on a minute!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.460
You could simply apologize!

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.950
We accept the challenge!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.180
Huh?

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:18.470
Why are you...

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:20.380
Well, whatever.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.100
You'd never be a match 
for us if we went by sales,

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.290
so we'll rely on reader reviews.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:30.100
You've got guts, boasting like that 
in front of the <i>real</i> Towano Chikai.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.640
It's a good handicap.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:34.050
After all, professional work 
and doujinshi are different.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:38.050
Now, if we win, then...

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.490
Ah-he has to do anything I ask her 
to do. How does that sound?

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:44.560
Haruna...

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:49.080
And if by some chance we <i>do</i> lose to you,

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.800
we'll bow our heads in apology.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.960
A simple apology isn't enough!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.070
If you lose,

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:59.240
you have to acknowledge Towano Chikai's
 work as a sibling romance story!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.950
From the depths of your heart!

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:03.980
Wh-What?

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:06.710
If we lose,

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.960
Hey, you can't be serious!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:11.060
Towano Chikai will retire
 from writing light novels!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.960
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.470
You didn't have to bet your career on it.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.890
As long as we win the 
competition, it doesn't matter.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.350
We have to win this, no matter what.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:26.160
Still... Sure, you know your light novels,

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.190
but those girls are doujinshi veterans.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:30.180
That doesn't matter.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:32.440
Didn't they frustrate the 
hell out of you, Onii-chan?

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.560
With everything they were saying.

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.570
Well, yeah, I guess.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.820
Doujinshi Sales

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.820
<b>Most 
Popular</b>

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:40.820
Ambivalence

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:40.820
They insulted my sibling romance story!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:44.490
They besmirched the 
culmination of our love!

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.170
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:50.580
This is the place?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:53.980
I've been waiting for you.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.630
Come in, come in.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.150
This is my room.

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:05.010
It's a pink, feminine space.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:14.280
What did you think of 
Ambivalence's doujinshi?

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:15.480
It was...

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.690
...entertaining.

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:20.570
The story, the structure, 
and the pacing were all good.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.420
And above all, the quality 
of their artwork is spectacular.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:28.910
How do you know those two, 
Double Peace-sensei?

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:33.380
We first met two years ago at ComiSta.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:38.520
Around that time, I was active in a circle,

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:41.320
and Runa-chan stopped at my island.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:44.080
She said she loved my illustrations.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.570
She'd seen drawings 
I'd uploaded to my website,

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.130
and she'd become a big fan.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:55.820
She even told me my art had 
inspired her to start drawing herself.

00:11:55.820 --> 00:12:00.270
Shortly after that, the two
 sisters founded Ambivalence.

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:04.450
It wasn't long before they 
stood out from the crowd.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:08.990
But the more famous Ambivalence 
became in the doujinshi world,

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:12.220
the rockier our relationship got.

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:15.200
Maybe our goals were too far apart?

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:17.130
I don't really know the reason.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:22.340
Either way, I still consider them friends.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:24.090
But...

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:28.400
I can't overlook them saying 
such awful things about you!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.430
I'll work hard to help you, too!

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:35.870
With you on my side, 
I'm sure we can beat them.

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.440
Let's all do what we can!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:41.600
In that case, there's something 
I'd like to ask of you two.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:42.980
Ask us anything!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:49.590
I have the perfect proposal 
for the competition,

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:52.400
but I don't have enough material to draw it!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:55.710
So I'd like you two to act it out.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.340
I-If you don't mind.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.180
Huh?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:03.800
What?

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:06.260
What <i>is</i> this?!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:10.140
And what are <i>you</i> wearing?!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.470
Please don't stare like that.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.120
A little sister who loves her brother 
so much, her S&M side has awoken!

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:18.340
Magnificent!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.360
What a glorious situation!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:23.150
Now, take all your pent up desires,

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.040
and unleash them on him!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.310
P-Please keep still, Onii-chan.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.410
This'll hurt if it hits you.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:33.800
Stop this!

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.370
Don't hit me!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.960
O-Onii-chan...

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.700
Why are you so...

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:43.260
...dense?!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.010
Every time I turn my back...

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.200
...you saunter up to other girls.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:50.200
Hey! Suzuka?!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:53.010
You don't know how I feel!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:55.890
You are <i>my</i> Onii-chan!

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:02.150
A sadistic little sister 
and a masochistic Sensei...

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.820
Stop this madness!

00:14:06.390 --> 00:14:09.090
Call me "Queen"!

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:13.030
Yes! Yes! Queen!

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.630
That was so wrong.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:29.550
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.460
Y-Yeah, it was.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:33.580
<i>After all, professional work and 
doujinshi are different.</i>

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:37.180
<i>A derivative work, huh?</i>

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.720
I wonder what we should throw in there.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.960
Wh-Why don't we do something like this?

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:44.440
Hm?

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.270
A-After the siblings start dating,

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:51.700
they go to the culture festival at the little 
sister's school and flirt with each other.

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:57.680
I mean, a doujinshi usually has stuff 
that can't take place in the main story,

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:02.050
s-so I thought I'd write something 
where the siblings are actually lovers.

00:15:02.050 --> 00:15:03.280
I see...

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.810
That sounds good!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:05.630
Huh?

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:11.200
Oh, i-in that case, I'd like 
to go on a fact-finding mission.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.680
So I was wondering if I could 
ask for your help, Onii-chan...

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.030
Of course!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.720
So what do you need me to do?

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.810
W-Well, you see...

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.640
Hm?

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:23.650
W-Will you come to my school's 
culture festival with me?

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.610
<b>Hakuou 
Girl's 
School</b>

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.610
<b>Culture
 Festival</b>

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.580
Welcome!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.360
Welcome!

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:34.320
The stage shows are being held over there.

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.320
Welcome!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.580
Students can exchange their tickets here!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.760
Hey, look over there.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.210
Wow, is that the student council president?

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:49.230
It's the fabled older brother...

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:51.400
He's a handome fella, isn't he?

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.690
Are they really as close as lovers?

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.920
I'm like, crazy jealous.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.110
Hey, Suzuka.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.140
Yes?

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:05.500
Why does everyone have 
such strange ideas about me?

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.430
Well, I was so happy about you coming 
here, I <i>may</i> have said something...

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:13.860
Ahem, I mean, they're just 
baseless rumors! I'm positive!

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:17.220
<i>That was a horrible attempt at lying to me...</i>

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:19.870
I see.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.420
All right, let's start "fact-finding," then.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:25.210
So currently, they're lovers,

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:28.260
and the older brother is 
taking her on a date, correct?

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.000
A d-date?!

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:31.080
Ah! Y-Yes, a date!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.160
It's a date!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:36.360
Uh, so could you please 
escort me, Onii-chan?

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:38.110
Is it me, or is there 
an ulterior motive to this?

00:16:38.110 --> 00:16:39.760
Y-You're imagining things.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:44.670
Now, Onii-chan, let's spend all day flirting!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.650
Oh, excuse me! Student Council President!

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.460
Um, and you are?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.340
We're from the theater club.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:15.100
In short, our two leads have suddenly 
fallen ill during the intermission.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:18.430
We've been running everywhere, 
trying to find people to replace them!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.720
Th-That sounds awful.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.950
We beg you!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.200
You're the only one we can turn 
to in our hour of need, President!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.150
You'd have to play a prince and princess. 
The perfect roles for two lovebirds like you!

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:33.400
<i>What was that about "baseless" rumors?!</i>

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:35.910
It's only for a little while!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.650
We're almost at the final scene!

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:41.810
Would you perform the scene where 
they confess their love for each other?!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.770
Huh?!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.000
<i>C-Confess?</i>

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:46.260
<i>To Onii-chan?!</i>

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:51.720
U-Um, President?

00:17:49.800 --> 00:17:53.170
<i>Onii-chan and me confessing our love...</i>

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.170
Is something wrong?

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.160
We'll do it!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:56.360
What?!

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:02.380
<i>The prince and princess finally realized 
how they felt about one another.</i>

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:05.980
<i>And so, the princess ventures forth to 
confess her forbidden love to her brother.</i>

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.690
So pretty.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:15.410
<i>How will the prince respond to 
the princess' declaration of love?</i>

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:18.930
So elegant!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.150
<i>Finally, the princess 
arrives before the prince.</i>

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:27.340
<i>After yearning to be with the prince 
she had been parted from for so long,</i>

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:30.260
<i>she finally resolves 
to declare her feelings.</i>

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:35.410
I have always, always loved you, Onii-sama.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:39.520
But I lacked the courage to tell you that,

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:41.480
so I kept my feelings hidden.

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.890
But I'm done running away from them!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:50.340
I don't want to just be 
your little sister forever!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:55.690
I want to be special 
in your eyes, Onii-sama!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.420
So I'll say it as many times as I must.

00:18:58.180 --> 00:19:00.320
I love you, Onii-chan!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.420
I love you with all my heart!

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.330
I love you <i>so</i> much.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.330
<i>Huh? That wasn't her line...</i>

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:15.190
<i>On hearing this confession, the prince 
responds to her long-held feelings.</i>

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:19.550
<i>L-Line! Where's the cue card?</i>

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:21.890
<b>Go 
with 
the 
flow!!</b>

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:22.760
<b>Go 
with 
the 
flow!!</b>

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:23.220
<b>Go 
with 
the 
flow!!</b>

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.680
<i>Hey! What was the point of that cue card?!</i>

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:29.360
<i>Wh-Wh-What should I do?!</i>

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:30.820
<i>I need something!</i>

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.560
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:36.210
<i>Suzuka will be fully immersed 
in her little sister character.</i>

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.690
<i>I should become the brother character...</i>

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.160
<i>What would Ryou say?!</i>

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.500
<i>Fine! Whatever!</i>

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:44.320
I-I...

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:49.330
I... I cannot return the 
feelings you have for me!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.250
You...

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.920
You have shared your 
true feelings with me.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:58.160
And in those feelings, 
there isn't a shred of doubt.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:01.940
Yet, I... still feel doubt.

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:06.620
Yes. I am hesitant!

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.350
But such indecisive feelings...

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:14.060
can never measure up to the 
strong feelings you have for me.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:15.770
But even so...

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:19.510
Hearing your words has made me so happy!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:22.290
I'm overjoyed to hear that you love me.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:26.070
So could you please give me some time?

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:30.790
I want to take an earnest look 
at the feelings I hold for you.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:36.250
So that I may return your 
feelings with equal honesty.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:38.700
Onii-chan...

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.740
I'm sorry that I cannot answer you right away.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.380
I truly am.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.010
But I promise you this, at least.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:49.010
We shall always be together. Forever.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.520
Yes.

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:55.310
Onii-chan!

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.420
I'm worn out.

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:08.660
Are you really?

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:12.810
Anyway, how do you feel 
the fact-finding mission went?

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.890
O-Oh, yes. I think I got some 
good hints on what to do.

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:21.080
Oh, and I think your response 
during the play was quite good.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:22.420
No, that was...

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:26.250
I was desperately trying 
to come up with something,

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:29.180
and it just kinda slipped out naturally.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:30.590
"Naturally"?

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:35.180
<i>C-Could that be h-how he truly feels?</i>

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.690
What's the matter, Suzuka?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:44.020
A-Actually, m-my c-confession 
was also how I truly—

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:44.690
Oh...

00:21:44.980 --> 00:21:45.590
Hm?

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:49.950
You're...

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.650
Kanzaka Akino!

00:23:24.960 --> 00:23:39.980
Illustration: YUG

00:23:25.640 --> 00:23:27.480
Yes, hello! Esaka-san here!

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:28.440
Haruna-chan's with us today!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:29.760
What's with this elementary schooler?

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:31.390
She's spouting some nonsense.

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:32.560
What's with your attitude?

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:35.120
Shut up! Just answer the questions!

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.980
Next Episode

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.980
My Sister and I Face a Doujinshi Contest We Can't Lose

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:35.860
I'm sorry.

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:37.610
Oh, time's up. See you later!

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:39.930
Elementary schoolers these 
days are something else.
